## 1. 엔드포인트

| HTTP | 경로 | 핸들러 | 직접 호출 |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/sales/{saleId}/shipment` | `Xgg74CommandController#createSellerShipment` | `Xgg74CommandService#createSellerShipment` |
| POST | `/sale-bids` | `Xzz58CommandController#createSaleBid` | `Xzz58CommandService#createSaleBid` |
| DELETE | `/sale-bids/{saleBidId}` | `Xzz58CommandController#deleteSaleBid` | `Xzz58CommandService#deleteSaleBid` |
| POST | `/sale-bids/instant` | `Xzz58CommandController#createInstantSale` | `Xzz58CommandService#createInstantSaleBid` |
| GET | `/sale-bids` | `Xzz58QueryController#getSaleBids` | `Xzz58QueryService#getSaleBids` |
| GET | `/sale-bids/count` | `Xzz58QueryController#getSaleBidStatusCounts` | `Xzz58QueryService#getSaleBidStatusCounts` |
| GET | `/sale-bids/{saleBidId}` | `Xzz58QueryController#getSaleBidDetail` | `Xzz58QueryService#getSaleBidDetail` |

