### service-command (3)

- `Xgg74CommandService` service/command/Xgg74CommandService.java · public: createInstantSale, createSale, createSellerShipment, updateSaleStatus, deleteSale · 주입: Xgg74Repository, Xzj27QueryService, Xkh73CommandService, Xrd81QueryService, Xxn30CommandService, Xbr34QueryService, Xgz75CommandService
- `Xgz75CommandService` service/command/Xgz75CommandService.java · public: createSaleBankAccount · 주입: Xgz75Repository
- `Xzz58CommandService` service/command/Xzz58CommandService.java · public: createSaleBid, createInstantSaleBid, deleteSaleBid · 주입: Xzz58Repository, Xrd81QueryService, Xdh20QueryService, Xgg74CommandService, Xzj27QueryService

